---
const terminalLines = [
  '$ gambit voice start --personality remy',
  '$ grym deploy homelab/caddy --branch main',
  '$ cargo build --release --features gpu',
  '$ kubectl get pods -n platform | wc -l → 847',
  '$ sysw sync --source radarr --full',
  '$ terraform plan -out=platform.tfplan',
];
---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">Building Platforms at Scale</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle reveal">// where infrastructure meets impact</p>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-prose reveal">
        <p>
          I build the platforms that engineering teams ship on. At Abridge AI, I grew the
          platform engineering organization from 1&nbsp;to&nbsp;25, standing up the Internal Developer
          Platform (Builders Portal), the cloud infrastructure, Kubernetes clusters, and CI/CD
          pipelines that let a healthcare AI company move fast without breaking
          compliance&mdash;FedRAMP, multi-region, the works.
        </p>
        <p>
          The real differentiator is the breadth behind the depth. I built a JARVIS-inspired
          voice AI assistant called <strong>Gambit</strong>&mdash;Electron + Go + Python,
          455&nbsp;tests, wake word detection to personality-driven speech. I built an autonomous
          AI agent (<strong>Grym</strong>) that manages real infrastructure via SSH and ships code
          through GitHub PRs. I built a real-time AI video engine in Rust that does
          segmentation at&nbsp;&lt;16ms per frame.
        </p>
        <p>
          The thesis is simple: curiosity isn&rsquo;t a hobby, it&rsquo;s an engineering
          superpower. The person who debugs GStreamer pipelines at night is the person who
          intuits why your production system is misbehaving at 3am.
        </p>
        <div class="about-links">
          <a href="/work" class="about-work-link mono">→ see the work</a>
          <a href="/gambit" class="about-work-link about-gambit-link mono">→ meet gambit</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-terminal reveal">
        <div class="terminal">
          <div class="terminal-bar">
            <span class="terminal-dot" style="background: #ef4444;"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot" style="background: var(--accent-amber);"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot" style="background: #22c55e;"></span>
            <span class="terminal-title mono">platform@grym:~</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body mono">
            {terminalLines.map((line, i) => (
              <div class="terminal-line" style={`animation-delay: ${i * 3}s;`}>
                <span class="terminal-prompt">▶</span>
                <span class="terminal-text">{line}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-prose p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-prose p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-prose strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-work-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), letter-spacing var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .about-work-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .about-gambit-link {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
  }

  .about-gambit-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  /* Terminal */
  .terminal {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }

  .terminal-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(4, 8, 18, 0.8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .terminal-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .terminal-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 2;
    min-height: 280px;
  }

  .terminal-line {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: terminalType 3s ease forwards;
    animation-iteration-count: 1;
  }

  .terminal-prompt {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .terminal-text {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  @keyframes terminalType {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-4px); }
    10% { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .terminal {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
